Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.30,0:00:05.90,Tour,,0,0,0,,This is Raelyn, your private semantic observatory.\NIt keeps unfolding events from getting lost in the stream.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:11.80,Tour,,0,0,0,,It extracts facts from video and gathers related events\Ninto a starfield you can replay and explore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.90,0:00:15.20,Tour,,0,0,0,,Events cluster by meaning, giving information structure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.30,0:00:18.60,Tour,,0,0,0,,Drill into any cluster and return to its sources and evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.70,0:00:22.10,Tour,,0,0,0,,Evidence-backed links connect these events into stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.20,0:00:25.30,Tour,,0,0,0,,Stories evolve across snapshots, always tied to evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:29.30,Tour,,0,0,0,,Choose a time span. Observation briefs turn it\Ninto a complete, citable narrative.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.40,0:00:33.70,Tour,,0,0,0,,Explanations lead back to video, transcripts, and context.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.80,0:00:37.00,Tour,,0,0,0,,Every source under continuous watch flows into one library.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.10,0:00:40.40,Tour,,0,0,0,,Material becomes searchable, traceable long-term memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.50,0:00:44.60,Tour,,0,0,0,,Work from collection to analysis stays fully observable.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.70,0:00:47.60,Tour,,0,0,0,,Calls, model usage, downloads, and storage share one ledger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.70,0:00:50.30,Tour,,0,0,0,,Long-term observation costs stay clear and controlled.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.40,0:00:53.70,Tour,,0,0,0,,Through MCP, agents enter the same semantic world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.80,0:00:57.20,Tour,,0,0,0,,Explore Raelyn on GitHub\Nhttps://github.com/scisaga/raelyn
